<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:12:52 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>伊朗局势升级似乎已成默认</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/opinion-escalation-in-iran-appears-as-the-default-video</link><description>美国和以色列暗杀了最高领袖阿里·哈梅内伊，他是唯一有权强迫达成令人难以接受的妥协的人，比如与华盛顿就政权强硬派达成协议。彭博社观点专栏作家马克·钱皮恩 (Marc Champion) 表示，这使得升级成为默认选项。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/opinion-escalation-in-iran-appears-as-the-default-video'&gt;伊朗局势升级似乎已成默认&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Escalation in Iran Appears As the Default&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/opinion-escalation-in-iran-appears-as-the-default-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:27:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>债券交易员纷纷对冲美联储加息导致经济停滞的风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bond-traders-rush-to-hedge-risk-of-fed-hikes-stalling-economy</link><description>债券交易商正在竞相对冲美联储加息和股市下滑将显着放缓美国经济的风险，迫使央行最早在明年底重新转向宽松货币政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bond-traders-rush-to-hedge-risk-of-fed-hikes-stalling-economy'&gt;债券交易员纷纷对冲美联储加息导致经济停滞的风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bond Traders Rush to Hedge Risk of Fed Hikes Stalling Economy&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/bond-traders-rush-to-hedge-risk-of-fed-hikes-stalling-economy</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纳斯达克 100 指数因人工智能溃败和关税上调谈话而下跌 2%：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>华尔街对人工智能贸易持久性的怀疑刺激了科技股的抛售，投资者也在解析有关美国新关税的讨论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;纳斯达克 100 指数因人工智能溃败和关税上调谈话而下跌 2%：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Falls 2% on AI Rout, Tariff Hike Talk: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>量化基金很难跟上这个市场的步伐</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</link><description>股市的叙事变化如此之快，即使是所谓的快钱也跟不上。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market'&gt;量化基金很难跟上这个市场的步伐&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Quant Funds Are Having a Hard Time Keeping Up With This Market&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/quant-funds-are-having-a-hard-time-keeping-up-with-this-market</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:36:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于全球抛售的影响，拉美货币落后于新兴货币</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade</link><description>由于金属价格下跌和美国科技股再次遭到抛售，大多数拉美货币周二暴跌，引发投资者逃离风险资产。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade'&gt;由于全球抛售的影响，拉美货币落后于新兴货币&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latam Currencies Lag Emerging Peers as Global Selloff Weighs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/emerging-market-stocks-rally-as-huang-s-return-revives-ai-trade</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:26:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英伟达兴奋消退、新关税迫在眉睫，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</link><description>周二，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌，芯片制造商再次大幅下跌，科技股的反弹让位于对人工智能交易持久性的新担忧。美国新关税计划也令股市承压。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally'&gt;英伟达兴奋消退、新关税迫在眉睫，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles as Nvidia Euphoria Fades, New Tariffs Loom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国准备对中国和欧盟商品加征关税</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video</link><description>据知情人士透露，美国将于周二宣布计划提高来自中国、欧盟和其他十几个经济体的商品关税。艾丽西亚·迪亚兹报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video'&gt;美国准备对中国和欧盟商品加征关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Readies Tariff Hike on China, EU Goods&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/us-readies-tariff-hike-on-china-eu-goods-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:58:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>投资者权衡美联储前景和美国关税计划，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</link><description>由于投资者押注进一步加息，而关税驱动的股市暴跌促使一些交易商出售黄金以弥补其他地方的损失，金价暴跌，抹去了周一大幅反弹的大部分内容。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally'&gt;投资者权衡美联储前景和美国关税计划，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slips as Investors Weigh Fed Outlook, US Tariff Plans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-gain-after-nvidia-s-rehiring-of-huang-sparks-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:06:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>